{"author":{"id":"686d9350e5e426946f54ca7a73ceeef9fd8682b44ea6617ce58187e451c43768"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790964081,"nonce":"cux3ecfgqgO9mpEOBzlsfTtl72g=","title":"the workspace builds only beside sibling x-idl, xgpu and xwindow checkouts","message":"The working tree as of 2026-10-02 (not yet committed) resolves three dependencies from sibling directories:\n\n- the root Cargo.toml patches x_idl to ../x-idl and xgpu's three crates to ../xgpu/crates/*, for x-idl's Library naming and HashLink Bytes layout and xgpu's HASHLINK_LIBRARY;\n- crates/hlwindow depends on ../../../xwindow/crates/{xwindow-backend,xwindow-bindgen,xwindow-core} by path, because xwindow is not pushed and `[patch]` cannot stand in for a git revision that does not exist remotely.\n\n`members = [\"crates/*\"]` includes hlwindow, so CI's workspace build fails without those checkouts beside it.\n\nBefore pushing: push x-idl, xgpu and xwindow, then replace the patches and path dependencies with pinned git revisions, and regenerate Cargo.lock. xwindow tracks its own pinning of x-idl as 07e388b0 in its git-bug.","files":null}]}